 col←row_count readVectorSimple(type_id _data)
⍝ Read simple integer/unsigned types from a DuckDB vector data pointer
⍝ type_id: DuckDB type ID (0-9)
⍝ _data: pointer to vector data
⍝ row_count (left arg): number of rows to read
 :Select type_id
 :CaseList 0
 :CaseList 1 2       ⍝ boolean and tinyint
     col←row_count read.i8 _data
 :Case 3             ⍝ smallint
     col←row_count read.i16 _data
 :Case 4             ⍝ integer
     col←row_count read.i32 _data
 :Case 5             ⍝ bigint
     col←row_count read.i64 _data
 :Case 6             ⍝ utinyint
     col←row_count read.u8 _data
 :Case 7             ⍝ usmallint
     col←row_count read.u16 _data
 :Case 8             ⍝ uinteger
     col←row_count read.u32 _data
 :Case 9             ⍝ ubigint
     col←row_count read.u64 _data
 :Else
     ∘∘∘
 :EndSelect
